  _subtitleCues:
  - StartTime: 0.7
    EndTime: 3.3
    TextEnglish: In the beginning...
    TextSpanish: En el principio...
  - StartTime: 4
    EndTime: 6.3
    TextEnglish: In the beginning... there was no weight.
    TextSpanish: "En el principio... no hab\xEDa peso."
  - StartTime: 6.8
    EndTime: 10.1
    TextEnglish: Only... the flow.
    TextSpanish: Solo... el flujo.
  - StartTime: 11.2
    EndTime: 14.3
    TextEnglish: But light breeds shadows...
    TextSpanish: Pero la luz engendra sombras...
  - StartTime: 14.8
    EndTime: 16.5
    TextEnglish: But light breeds shadows... and fear...
    TextSpanish: Pero la luz engendra sombras... y el miedo...
  - StartTime: 16.8
    EndTime: 20.1
    TextEnglish: ...is the poison of rulers.
    TextSpanish: ...es el veneno de los gobernantes.
  - StartTime: 21.1
    EndTime: 27.1
    TextEnglish: To protect his own domain... he decreed the end of the cycle...
    TextSpanish: "Para proteger su propio dominio... decret\xF3 el fin del ciclo..."
  - StartTime: 27.5
    EndTime: 30.3
    TextEnglish: ...and sealed our sky.
    TextSpanish: "...y sell\xF3 nuestro cielo."
  - StartTime: 31.5
    EndTime: 35.3
    TextEnglish: He left behind his most loyal Sentinel...
    TextSpanish: "Dej\xF3 atr\xE1s a su Centinela m\xE1s leal..."
  - StartTime: 35.6
    EndTime: 38.3
    TextEnglish: ...to guard the heights.
    TextSpanish: ...para custodiar las alturas.
  - StartTime: 39
    EndTime: 42.1
    TextEnglish: Trapped beneath the seal...
    TextSpanish: Atrapados bajo el sello...
  - StartTime: 42.6
    EndTime: 46.1
    TextEnglish: ...we were stripped of birth.
    TextSpanish: ...fuimos despojados del nacimiento.
  - StartTime: 47.2
    EndTime: 49.6
    TextEnglish: We grew dense.
    TextSpanish: Nos volvimos densos.
  - StartTime: 50.2
    EndTime: 56.4
    TextEnglish: Fusing together... solidifying our essence into prisons of crystal... mud... and stone.
    TextSpanish: "Fusion\xE1ndonos... solidificando nuestra esencia en prisiones de cristal... lodo... y piedra."
  - StartTime: 57.3
    EndTime: 59.3
    TextEnglish: And yet...
    TextSpanish: Y sin embargo...
  - StartTime: 59.7
    EndTime: 62.7
    TextEnglish: And yet... in the lowest stratum...
    TextSpanish: "Y sin embargo... en el estrato m\xE1s profundo..."
  - StartTime: 63
    EndTime: 66.2
    TextEnglish: ...where despair reigns...
    TextSpanish: "...donde reina la desesperaci\xF3n..."
  - StartTime: 67.1
    EndTime: 71.5
    TextEnglish: ...an ancient spark refuses to fade.
    TextSpanish: ...una chispa ancestral se niega a apagarse.
  - StartTime: 72
    EndTime: 74.1
    TextEnglish: A Lumen.
    TextSpanish: Un Lumen.
  - StartTime: 75.3
    EndTime: 77
    TextEnglish: Rise.
    TextSpanish: "\xC1lzate."
  - StartTime: 77.3
    EndTime: 79.9
    TextEnglish: Rise. Defy the Sentinel.
    TextSpanish: "\xC1lzate. Desaf\xEDa al Centinela."
  - StartTime: 80.3
    EndTime: 83.1
    TextEnglish: Reclaim the heights.
    TextSpanish: Reclama las alturas.
  - StartTime: 84.4
    EndTime: 86.4
    TextEnglish: And discover...
    TextSpanish: Y descubre...
  - StartTime: 86.7
    EndTime: 89.2
    TextEnglish: And discover... what was stolen from us...
    TextSpanish: Y descubre... lo que nos fue arrebatado...
  - StartTime: 89.5
    EndTime: 92.6
    TextEnglish: ...beyond the sky of stone.
    TextSpanish: "...m\xE1s all\xE1 del cielo de piedra."
